    <briefdescription>
<para>Manages the immutable history keyspace. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>History keys are stored as: <computeroutput>hist:&lt;base_key&gt;\x00&lt;8-byte-big-endian-HLC-ts&gt;</computeroutput></para>
<para>This allows a prefix scan over <computeroutput>hist:&lt;base_key&gt;\x00</computeroutput> to iterate all versions in chronological order, consistent with the existing <ref refid="classthemis_1_1_m_v_c_c_store" kindref="compound">MVCCStore</ref> versioned-key scheme.</para>
<para>Thread-safety: Read operations are thread-safe. Write operations must be performed within a single-writer transaction to guarantee atomicity with live-key writes. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
